ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 72 706 Tm
(- Current bottlenecks: psycopg2.connect\(\) creates a fresh blocking DB) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 72 689 Tm
(connection per call; the app does not show an async database pool; LLM calls) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 72 672 Tm
(and vector searches can become latency hotspots; document extraction is) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 72 655 Tm
