/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 72 537 Tm
(async DB access or worker isolation, Redis or another external session/cache) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 72 520 Tm
(layer, separate queues for document ingestion and long LLM jobs, horizontal) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 72 503 Tm
(stateless API replicas behind a load balancer, and rate limits with) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 72 486 Tm
(backpressure.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 72 461 Tm
(- Critical booking safety: slot booking must stay transactional with unique) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 72 444 Tm
